Z||000000||loafer87gt||09-18-2000||01:04 PM||||I have looked everywhere trying to track down a set of used 5 spoke Cavalier wheels for my GT, and have had no luck. I tried posting in the auto.gm newsgroup and called all my local autowreckers and haven't been able to find a set anywhere. I called GM and they said that they could sell me a set for $2300 plus taxes (yikes!!), but this is almost 3x as much as a set of aftermarket wheels. If anyone ever finds a set of used ones for sale at a reasonable price, can they drop me a line||||reg||1
